      "voiceover": {
        "text": "Here the joints don't all move the same way. The hip, a ball-and-socket joint, flexes. The knee, a hinge, extends as the shin whips through. And the ankle, a hinge, stays plantar flexed. The classic mistake is saying the whole leg flexes, when the knee is extending."
